# Marketing positioning

Digital Growth & Marketing is a core official pillar, not a footnote. Use that exact pillar name. Frame it as a connected business system, not "social media services" and not a shortened label such as "Digital Growth" or "Digital Marketing" when naming the pillar.

The pillar may still list capabilities: lead generation, lead management, lead qualification, high-conversion websites, landing pages, branding, SEO, search visibility, content strategy, digital marketing, marketing automation, CRM integration, analytics, conversion optimization.

Show the connected system: traffic → landing page → lead → CRM → qualification → follow-up → conversion → reporting.

Final CTA is a business-problem ask, not "Need a website?":

- Headline: Have a business problem worth solving?
- Support: Tell us what you're trying to improve. We'll help you figure out whether the answer is software, automation, marketing, or something else.
- Button: Start a Project

PrintSahaj footer/company copy must not say "verification system for India's printing and packaging industry." That line is PrintVerify-only.

## Portfolio accuracy

Never invent a client, project, product, feature, result, metric, testimonial, technology, business outcome, launch status, capability, certification, award, or case-study claim. If uncertain: CONTENT GAP — NEEDS VERIFICATION. Do not infer.

Status enum only: Live | Building | Concept | Internal | Not publicly disclosed. Use Live only with verified evidence that the project is live and publicly presentable. Do not assume permission to name a client because a project folder exists.

Homepage: 4–6 verified projects, full list later on `/work`. Sibling apps live outside this repo — inspect them before naming features as shipped.

Internal inventory until Satyam confirms otherwise:

- Flexora: Building. Do not describe unverified modules as live features.
- Pactech Nexus: candidate portfolio project. Do not make an unsupported Live claim.
- ATS / LeadTrack: hold from public portfolio. CONTENT GAP — PUBLIC NAME NEEDS CONFIRMATION. Do not guess ATS LeadTracker, ATS Lead Tracker, LeadTrack, or LeadTrack CRM as the public name.
- Aivy, SmartTrack, RuchiLeadBot, Ayesha, Birla Opus: hold.
